{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TAKE YOUR GAME TO THE NEXT LEVEL IN DISC GOLF MASTERS</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BAG YOUR PRO CAREER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from the bottom and grind your way to the top. Challenge the world's best players, earn your spot on the leaderboard, and build a legacy that puts your name in disc golf history.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAL COURSES. REAL PROS. REAL STAKES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tee off on faithfully recreated courses inspired by real-world locations. Play as the sport's biggest names, each with their own unique style, and take your game online against players worldwide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEEL EVERY THROW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep physics engine captures the true flight of every disc \u2014 hyzer, anhyzer, turnover, fade. Read the wind, pick your line, and shape shots that actually behave like disc golf.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR DISC. YOUR LOOK.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck out your player with officially licensed discs from top brands, plus apparel and accessories to match your vibe on the course.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2819400?t=1772186439","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2819400?t=1772186439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819400/469b21777363a41d086247e5bb33f9bc41d1ad2c/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772186439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819400/469b21777363a41d086247e5bb33f9bc41d1ad2c/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772186439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4196270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TAKE YOUR GAME TO THE NEXT LEVEL IN DISC GOLF MASTERS</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BAG YOUR PRO CAREER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from the bottom and grind your way to the top. Challenge the world's best players, earn your spot on the leaderboard, and build a legacy that puts your name in disc golf history.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAL COURSES. REAL PROS. REAL STAKES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tee off on faithfully recreated courses inspired by real-world locations. Play as the sport's biggest names, each with their own unique style, and take your game online against players worldwide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEEL EVERY THROW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep physics engine captures the true flight of every disc \u2014 hyzer, anhyzer, turnover, fade. Read the wind, pick your line, and shape shots that actually behave like disc golf.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR DISC. YOUR LOOK.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck out your player with officially licensed discs from top brands, plus apparel and accessories to match your vibe on the course.</p>","developers":["Spinoff Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819400/d7590884d61957d79750628d59d783de7af970d5/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772186439","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2819400/536308301/da700c01004797cbac8c735d6607fcd9c42d7ca0/1770386547/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770387728","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2819400/536308301/da700c01004797cbac8c735d6607fcd9c42d7ca0/1770386547/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770387728","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.